{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTHuvtkm9Fxzv6tBwooULS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Composability claim requires calibration: ''OntoCoDec composes\n2\t  with FT at minimal cost'' rather than ''zero cost.'' FT is the primary mechanism\n3\t  for violation reduction (DR 18.7%→0.76% Qwen, 26.07%→0.49% Llama), OntoCoDec provides\n4\t  the residual guarantee with a small but acceptable F1 trade-off in the FT regime.\n5\t  DocRED high tightness (τ̄=0.842) causes more frequent grammar-first fallback than\n6\t  SciERC (τ̄=0.333), explaining why DR does not reach 0% even with FT+constrained.\n7\t  Well-calibrated FT models have less headroom for constraint-driven precision gains\n8\t  — unlike zero-shot where grammar eliminates OOV FPs (RV 29.66%→0%), FT baseline\n9\t  RV is already <0.3%, so grammar layer has negligible F1 benefit, while semantic\n10\t  layer''s logit masking introduces mild overhead. Paper still strong: zero-shot results\n11\t  are the core contribution; FT composability is §5.4 supplementary validation showing\n12\t  method robustness. Soften ''zero F1 cost'' to ''negligible F1 cost'' in abstract.\n13\t  Still targets Accept.\n14\t\n15\t  '\n16\timagined_experiments:\n17\t- name: Qwen DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\n18\t  plan_id: w5_qwen_docred_lora_constrained_eval\n19\t  description: 'Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Qwen3-8B fine-tuned\n20\t    with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix (base/FT\n21\t    × unconstrained/constrained) for Qwen on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.76%,\n22\t    RV=0.27%, ET=0%, CF=0.12%, R-F1=40.86%, E-F1=82.15%, parse_fail=7.11%.\n23\t\n24\t    '\n25\t  expected_results:\n26\t    DR_pct: 0.32\n27\t    RV_pct: 0.0\n28\t    ET_pct: 0.0\n29\t    CF_pct: 1.5\n30\t    R_F1: 40.35\n31\t    R_precision: 36.05\n32\t    R_recall: 45.8\n33\t    E_F1: 81.9\n34\t    E_precision: 85.2\n35\t    E_recall: 78.85\n36\t    parse_fail_rate_pct: 9.2\n37\t    total_entities_pred: ~18050\n38\t    total_relations_pred: ~15800\n39\t    R_F1_delta_pp: -0.51\n40\t    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.25\n41\t    DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct: -57.9\n42\t    CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp: 1.38\n43\t  result_rationale: 'DR 0.76%→0.32%: FT已将DR从18.46%削减至0.76%（↓96%），残余主要集中在tight-constraint\n44\t    关系（如P31_instance_of τ=0.98, P1001_applies_to_jurisdiction τ=0.95）。OntoCoDec semantic层可进一步消除部分残余，但DocRED\n45\t    τ̄=0.842导致大量token位置触发 grammar-first fallback（零代码DocRED full_s1约57次/doc）。FT模型fallback频率略低\n46\t    （模型输出更规范，减少空集交集），但仍显著高于SciERC。残余0.32%来自：(1) fallback 退化到grammar-only的token位置上，模型生成了合法关系名但违规的domain/range组合；\n47\t    (2) FT模型在极少数tight-constraint关系上的latent DR violation（FT学到了常见pattern 但未完全覆盖罕见的合法entity-type对）。相比SciERC\n48\t    FT+constrained的DR=0.0%（Qwen）， DocRED的非零残余反映了ontology complexity对constraint coverage的系统性影响。\n49\t\n50\t    RV/ET→0%: Grammar层确保——与FT无关，和零代码行为一致。\n51\t\n52\t    R-F1 40.86→40.35（-0.51pp）: FT模型RV baseline仅0.27%（vs零代码29.66%），grammar层 几乎无precision提升空间（零代码时grammar消除OOV\n53\t    FP是F1提升的唯一来源）。同时semantic 层的logit masking在well-calibrated模型上产生轻微质量损失：FT模型的type\n54\t    assignment已高度 准确，semantic mask偶尔会阻止模型的正确首选token，迫使其选择次优但合法的替代——这在 SciERC上影响极小（-0.09pp），但DocRED\n55\t    96个关系×高tightness意味着更多masking事件累积 为可测量的F1下降。Recall略降（constraint偶尔导致relation slot生成次优triple），\n56\t    precision略降（少量新引入的CF violation对应的triple被checker计为violation但all_set 评测仍计入FP）。-0.51pp在统计上可能仅marginal\n57\t    significant（bootstrap p~0.03-0.08）， 是\"可接受的composability税\"而非方法缺陷。\n58\t\n59\t    CF 0.12%→1.5%: Semantic层引入entity-vs-relation type drift（与零代码机制相同）， 但FT模型已内化entity\n60\t    type conventions，CF远低于零代码（零代码Qwen DocRED CF=2.57%）。 SciERC FT CF=1.18%是参考锚点；DocRED因96关系×高tightness导致更多semantic\n61\t    enforcement 事件，CF略高于SciERC FT但远低于零代码。主要冲突模式预测：location↔country, organization↔political_party等DocRED\n62\t    type system边界模糊区。\n63\t\n64\t    Parse fail 7.11%→9.2%（+2.1pp）: Qwen FT在DocRED上unconstrained已有较高parse failure （7.11%,\n65\t    71/998 samples）。Constrained decoding的grammar enforcement在长文档上增加 generation复杂度，导致部分样本超时或生成中断。增幅与零代码（12/998→11/998，几乎不变）\n66\t    不同，因为FT模型生成更长、更详细的输出（平均triple数~16-17per doc），constraint enforcement的累积overhead更大。\n67\t\n68\t    '\n69\t  tables:\n70\t  - name: 'Table: Qwen DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix'\n71\t    content: '| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\n72\t\n73\t      |---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\n74\t\n75\t      | Zero-shot unconst.  | 18.46 | 29.66 | 2.48 | 0.10  |  7.74  | 58.15  |\n76\t\n77\t      | Zero-shot full_s1   | 10.21 |  0.03 | 0.00 | 2.57  |  8.23  | 59.37  |\n78\t\n79\t      | FT unconstrained    |  0.76 |  0.27 | 0.00 | 0.12  | 40.86  | 82.15  |\n80\t\n81\t      | FT full_s1          |  0.32 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 1.50  | 40.35  | 81.90  |\n82\t\n83\t      '\n84\t  - name: 'Table: Qwen DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)'\n85\t    content: '| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR%\n86\t      | Δ       |\n87\t\n88\t      |----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\n89\t\n90\t      | P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.8            | 0.9          | -0.9pp  |\n91\t\n92\t      | P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 1.2            | 0.4          | -0.8pp  |\n93\t\n94\t      | P710_participant           | 0.92  | 0.5            | 0.1          | -0.4pp  |\n95\t\n96\t      | Used-for (大部分)           | <0.5  | 0.0            | 0.0          | 0       |\n97\t\n98\t      '\n99\t  figures_description:\n100\t  - 'Bar chart: DR reduction cascade across 4 configs (zero-shot-unc → zero-shot-const\n101\t    → FT-unc → FT-const), 显示FT和OntoCoDec的互补贡献——FT负责bulk reduction (18.46→0.76), OntoCoDec负责residual\n102\t    guarantee (0.76→0.32)'\n103\t  - 'Scatter: relation tightness τ vs FT+constrained DR%, 预期只有τ>0.9的关系有非零DR残余, 与零代码pattern一致但整体水平低一个数量级'\n104\t  analysis: 'Qwen DocRED FT+constrained结果在median tier下支持calibrated composability claim：\n105\t    FT is the primary mechanism (DR↓96%), OntoCoDec provides marginal but real additional\n106\t    reduction (0.76→0.32, ↓58%). R-F1 cost -0.51pp is the price of this guarantee,\n107\t    acceptable for compliance-critical applications. 与SciERC FT+constrained（DR=0%,\n108\t    R-F1=-0.09pp）的差距归因于ontology complexity: DocRED τ̄=0.842导致高fallback率， SciERC τ̄=0.333几乎不触发fallback。这不是方法局限而是可量化的tightness效应——\n109\t    paper §5.4应报告fallback率差异作为解释。CF 1.5%与SciERC FT（1.18%）同量级， 确认FT大幅缓解CF问题（vs零代码CF=2.57%）。\n110\t\n111\t    论文framing调整：§5.4从\"FT+OntoCoDec = zero cost\"改为\"FT+OntoCoDec = negligible cost (R-F1\n112\t    -0.5pp) with guaranteed DR reduction below 0.5%\"。Abstract中\"zero F1 cost\" 改为\"negligible\n113\t    F1 cost in the FT regime\"。\n114\t\n115\t    '\n116\t- name: Llama DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\n117\t  plan_id: w5_llama_docred_lora_constrained_eval\n118\t  description: 'Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Llama-3.1-8B fine-tuned\n119\t    with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix for Llama\n120\t    on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.49%, RV=0.15%, ET=0%, R-F1=43.72%,\n121\t    E-F1=83.93%, parse_fail=2.3%.\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t  expected_results:\n125\t    DR_pct: 0.15\n126\t    RV_pct: 0.0\n127\t    ET_pct: 0.0\n128\t    CF_pct: 2.0\n129\t    R_F1: 43.42\n130\t    R_precision: 38.4\n131\t    R_recall: 50.1\n132\t    E_F1: 83.55\n133\t    E_precision: 84.6\n134\t    E_recall: 82.52\n135\t    parse_fail_rate_pct: 3.8\n136\t    total_entities_pred: ~19050\n137\t    total_relations_pred: ~16100\n138\t    R_F1_delta_pp: -0.3\n139\t    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.38\n140\t    DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct: -69.4\n141\t    CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp: ~2.0\n142\t  result_rationale: 'DR 0.49%→0.15%: Llama FT baseline DR已极低（0.49%），低于Qwen FT（0.76%）。\n143\t    两个因素解释Llama更低的残余：(1) Llama在DocRED上zero-shot RV baseline较低 （16.03% vs Qwen 29.66%），FT后RV更接近零（0.15%），grammar层处理更少OOV→\n144\t    semantic层获得更干净的输入→更少fallback事件；(2) Llama FT在SciERC上constrained DR=0.09%（vs Qwen\n145\t    0.0%），显示两模型在低DR区间差异微小。DocRED残余0.15%来自 极少数high-tightness关系（P31 τ=0.98等），这些关系的constraint空间极窄，FT\n146\t    无法完全学习所有合法pair，OntoCoDec在fallback区域也无法覆盖。\n147\t\n148\t    R-F1 43.72→43.42（-0.30pp）: Llama在SciERC FT+constrained上实现+0.02pp（中性）， 但DocRED的高tightness增加constraint\n149\t    overhead。-0.30pp比Qwen（-0.51pp）更小， 与两模型在零代码上的pattern一致：Llama对constraint decoding更robust（零代码\n150\t    DocRED R-F1 Llama +0.29pp vs Qwen +0.50pp，注意Qwen实际是从更低基线提升更多， 而Llama是从更高基线提升更少但也为正）。FT\n151\t    regime下Llama的正向F1效应不再存在 （RV已被FT消除，无OOV FP可移除），剩余的是纯constraint overhead。-0.30pp在\n152\t    bootstrap CI下预期p~0.05-0.15，即borderline significant——可报告为\"mild cost\" 但不构成论文攻击面。\n153\t\n154\t    CF 2.0%: Llama零代码DocRED CF=12.02%（远高于Qwen 2.57%），FT大幅降低但Llama 在CF上的系统性偏高延续到FT\n155\t    regime。SciERC FT Llama CF=0.46%（低于Qwen 1.18%）， 但SciERC只有7个关系，DocRED 96个关系的type空间更复杂。预测2.0%——高于Qwen\n156\t    FT+constrained（1.5%），因Llama在DocRED semantic enforcement下的entity-type drift更明显。这与零代码的跨模型pattern一致（Llama\n157\t    DocRED CF始终高于Qwen）。 主要冲突模式：person↔politician, location↔country, organization↔company——\n158\t    DocRED type system中语义重叠最严重的类别。\n159\t\n160\t    Parse fail 2.3%→3.8%（+1.5pp）: Llama FT parse stability优于Qwen（2.3% vs 7.11%）， constrained\n161\t    decoding增加的overhead也更小。零代码Llama DocRED constrained parse failure从68→91（+2.3pp），FT模型输出更规范，增幅略低。3.8%仍远低于Qwen\n162\t    FT+constrained的9.2%——跨模型parse robustness差异是系统性的。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t  tables:\n166\t  - name: 'Table: Llama DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix'\n167\t    content: '| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\n168\t\n169\t      |---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\n170\t\n171\t      | Zero-shot unconst.  | 26.07 | 16.03 | 0.13 | 0.17  |  5.98  | 55.65  |\n172\t\n173\t      | Zero-shot full_s1   |  2.55 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 12.02 |  6.27  | 55.01  |\n174\t\n175\t      | FT unconstrained    |  0.49 |  0.15 | 0.00 | ~0    | 43.72  | 83.93  |\n176\t\n177\t      | FT full_s1          |  0.15 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 2.00  | 43.42  | 83.55  |\n178\t\n179\t      '\n180\t  - name: 'Table: Llama DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)'\n181\t    content: '| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR%\n182\t      | Δ       |\n183\t\n184\t      |----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\n185\t\n186\t      | P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.0            | 0.3          | -0.7pp  |\n187\t\n188\t      | P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 0.6            | 0.1          | -0.5pp  |\n189\t\n190\t      | Others (τ<0.9)             | <0.9  | ~0.0           | 0.0          | 0       |\n191\t\n192\t      '\n193\t  figures_description:\n194\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 跨模型DocRED FT+constrained对比 — Qwen vs Llama在DR/CF/R-F1三个指标上的对比,\n195\t    显示Llama在DR和R-F1上更优但CF略高'\n196\t  - 'Heatmap: 2模型×2数据集×4配置的DR矩阵, 对角线颜色梯度显示FT+constrained是最深绿色（最低DR）'\n197\t  analysis: 'Llama DocRED FT+constrained在median tier下表现略优于Qwen：DR更低（0.15% vs 0.32%），\n198\t    R-F1损失更小（-0.30pp vs -0.51pp），parse failure更低（3.8% vs 9.2%）。但CF更高 （2.0% vs 1.5%），延续了Llama在DocRED上CF偏高的系统性pattern。\n199\t\n200\t    跨模型composability claim在median tier下仍然成立但需要nuance：两个模型都实现了 DR<0.5%（远低于零代码的10-26%），R-F1代价均<1pp，确认FT+OntoCoDec是robust的\n201\t    composable pipeline。但R-F1不再是\"zero cost\"——需要修改为\"minimal cost\"。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t- name: DocRED FT Composability 2×2 Matrix Analysis (Cross-Model)\n205\t  plan_id: analysis_docred_ft_composability_cross_model\n206\t  description: '综合Qwen和Llama两个模型在DocRED上的2×2矩阵（base/FT × unconstrained/constrained），\n207\t    产出跨模型composability的统一分析。此分析在两个constrained eval完成后执行。\n208\t\n209\t    '\n210\t  expected_results:\n211\t    qwen_dr_ft_constrained: 0.32\n212\t    llama_dr_ft_constrained: 0.15\n213\t    qwen_r_f1_delta_ft_regime: -0.51\n214\t    llama_r_f1_delta_ft_regime: -0.3\n215\t    qwen_cf_ft_constrained: 1.5\n216\t    llama_cf_ft_constrained: 2.0\n217\t    ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_qwen: 96\n218\t    ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_llama: 98\n219\t    ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_qwen: 58\n220\t    ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_llama: 69\n221\t    total_dr_reduction_pct_qwen: 98.3\n222\t    total_dr_reduction_pct_llama: 99.4\n223\t  result_rationale: '2×2矩阵的核心insight是FT和OntoCoDec在DR reduction pipeline中占据不同阶段： FT负责bulk\n224\t    reduction（18-26%→0.5-0.8%，↓96-98%），OntoCoDec负责residual guarantee（0.5-0.8%→0.15-0.32%，再↓58-69%）。两阶段组合实现98-99%总DR消除。\n225\t\n226\t    在median tier下，composability的代价是非零的：R-F1损失0.3-0.5pp，CF增加 1.5-2.0pp。这些代价在SciERC\n227\t    FT regime几乎不存在（R-F1 ±0.1pp, CF 0.5-1.2%）， 差异归因于DocRED ontology complexity（τ̄=0.842\n228\t    vs 0.333）。\n229\t\n230\t    关键发现：FT+OntoCoDec对CF的影响远小于零代码+OntoCoDec——SciERC从9.90%降至 1.18%（Qwen）/ 0.46%（Llama），DocRED预期从2.57%到1.5%（Qwen）/\n231\t    12.02%到 2.0%（Llama）。FT通过内化entity type conventions大幅减少entity-vs-relation type drift。这支持\"FT\n232\t    resolves the CF trade-off that is the primary limitation in zero-shot deployment\"的framing——CF不再是Limitation\n233\t    #1，而是已被FT缓解的 secondary concern。\n234\t\n235\t    '\n236\t  tables:\n237\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Model DocRED Composability Summary'\n238\t    content: '| Metric               | Qwen zero-shot | Qwen FT    | Llama zero-shot\n239\t      | Llama FT   |\n240\t\n241\t      |----------------------|----------------|------------|-----------------|------------|\n242\t\n243\t      | DR (unconst.)        | 18.46%         | 0.76%      | 26.07%          | 0.49%      |\n244\t\n245\t      | DR (constrained)     | 10.21%         | 0.32%      | 2.55%           | 0.15%      |\n246\t\n247\t      | DR Δ (const-unconst) | -8.25pp        | -0.44pp    | -23.52pp        | -0.34pp    |\n248\t\n249\t      | R-F1 (unconst.)      | 7.74           | 40.86      | 5.98            | 43.72      |\n250\t\n251\t      | R-F1 (constrained)   | 8.23           | 40.35      | 6.27            | 43.42      |\n252\t\n253\t      | R-F1 Δ               | +0.49pp        | -0.51pp    | +0.29pp         | -0.30pp    |\n254\t\n255\t      | CF (constrained)     | 2.57%          | 1.50%      | 12.02%          | 2.00%      |\n256\t\n257\t      '\n258\t  - name: 'Table: DR Attribution — FT vs OntoCoDec Contribution'\n259\t    content: '| Model | Baseline DR | After FT | After FT+OntoCoDec | FT contrib.\n260\t      | OntoCoDec contrib. |\n261\t\n262\t      |-------|------------|----------|--------------------|-------------|-------------------|\n263\t\n264\t      | Qwen  | 18.46%     | 0.76%    | 0.32%              | ↓95.9%      | ↓57.9%\n265\t      of residual |\n266\t\n267\t      | Llama | 26.07%     | 0.49%    | 0.15%              | ↓98.1%      | ↓69.4%\n268\t      of residual |\n269\t\n270\t      '\n271\t  figures_description:\n272\t  - 'Stacked bar: DR reduction分解为FT contribution和OntoCoDec contribution, 两个模型并排, 直观展示''FT\n273\t    does the heavy lifting, OntoCoDec provides the residual guarantee'''\n274\t  - 'Line plot: R-F1 across 4 configs (x=config, y=R-F1), 两条线(Qwen/Llama), 标注FT→FT+const的delta,\n275\t    显示FT regime下constrained decoding的marginal F1 cost'\n276\t  analysis: \"Median tier下的论文叙事调整：\\n1. Abstract: \\\"zero F1 cost\\\" → \\\"negligible F1\\\n277\t    \\ cost (≤0.5pp) in the fine-tuned\\n   regime, with zero cost confirmed in zero-shot\\\n278\t    \\ settings\\\"\\n\\n2. §5.4 FT Composability: 核心message是\\\"OntoCoDec composes with\\\n279\t    \\ FT at minimal\\n   cost, providing guaranteed DR<0.5% that FT alone cannot achieve.\\\"\\\n280\t    \\ 报告具体的\\n   R-F1 cost（-0.3 to -0.5pp）和DR benefit（additional 58-69% reduction of\\n\\\n281\t    \\   FT residual）。Acknowledge这是composability tax，但对比post-hoc filtering\\n   的recall\\\n282\t    \\ loss（-1.06pp DocRED）和information loss（48.1% triples rejected），\\n   OntoCoDec的trade-off更favorable。\\n\\\n283\t    \\n3. CF discussion: FT+OntoCoDec CF（1.5-2.0%）远低于零代码+OntoCoDec CF\\n   （2.57-12.02%），这是positive\\\n284\t    \\ finding。在§7 Limitations中保留CF作为\\n   inherent limitation，但补充\\\"FT substantially\\\n285\t    \\ mitigates CF (88% reduction\\n   on SciERC, 42-83% on DocRED)\\\"。\\n\\n4. 投稿策略:\\\n286\t    \\ Median tier下论文仍targets Accept——核心贡献（violation landscape\\n   + method + zero-shot\\\n287\t    \\ results）不受影响，FT composability section变为\\\"§5.4\\n   analysis showing method robustness\\\n288\t    \\ under different training regimes\\\"而非\\n   headline claim。总体预期评分3.5-4.0，主要风险从FT\\\n289\t    \\ composability转移回CF\\n   trade-off和novelty perception。\\n\"\n290\t- name: Bootstrap CI for DocRED FT Composability\n291\t  plan_id: analysis_bootstrap_ci_docred_ft\n292\t  description: '对两个模型的DocRED FT+constrained vs FT+unconstrained进行bootstrap CI（10000\n293\t    iterations），验证R-F1 delta的统计显著性。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t  expected_results:\n297\t    qwen_r_f1_delta_pp: -0.51\n298\t    qwen_r_f1_95ci_lower: -0.95\n299\t    qwen_r_f1_95ci_upper: -0.08\n300\t    qwen_p_value: 0.04\n301\t    qwen_significance: marginal (p<0.05 but CI wide)\n302\t    llama_r_f1_delta_pp: -0.3\n303\t    llama_r_f1_95ci_lower: -0.72\n304\t    llama_r_f1_95ci_upper: 0.1\n305\t    llama_p_value: 0.11\n306\t    llama_significance: not significant (CI crosses zero)\n307\t    qwen_e_f1_delta_pp: -0.25\n308\t    qwen_e_f1_p_value: 0.15\n309\t    llama_e_f1_delta_pp: -0.38\n310\t    llama_e_f1_p_value: 0.08\n311\t  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI在median tier下的预期pattern：\n312\t\n313\t    Qwen R-F1 -0.51pp: DocRED有998个文档，FT模型每文档~16-17 triples，给予足够 统计功效检测0.5pp级别的差异。预期p~0.04（marginal\n314\t    significant），95% CI [-0.95, -0.08]——不跨零但upper bound接近零。这意味着差异是real的但small。 论文可报告为\"statistically\n315\t    detectable but practically negligible\"。\n316\t\n317\t    Llama R-F1 -0.30pp: 更小的effect size + Llama更高的parse failure（降低有效 样本量）→ 预期p~0.11（not\n318\t    significant）。CI [-0.72, +0.10]跨零。这实际上 是positive outcome——无法拒绝\"Llama FT+constrained\n319\t    R-F1 ≈ FT unconstrained\" 的零假设，支持\"negligible cost\" framing。\n320\t\n321\t    E-F1的delta更小（-0.25, -0.38pp），在E-F1的基数（82-84%）下effect size更小， 预期均not significant——constrained\n322\t    decoding对entity extraction的影响在FT regime下可忽略。\n323\t\n324\t    论文reporting策略：只需报告R-F1的bootstrap CI。如果Qwen marginal significant 而Llama not significant，frame为\"R-F1\n325\t    cost is model-dependent: Qwen shows a small but detectable -0.5pp decline (p=0.04),\n326\t    while Llama shows no significant change (-0.3pp, p=0.11)\"。这比uniform \"no cost\"\n327\t    claim更honest也更robust。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  tables:\n331\t  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap CI for FT Composability on DocRED'\n332\t    content: '| Model | Metric | Δpp   | 95% CI          | p-value | Significant?\n333\t      |\n334\t\n335\t      |-------|--------|-------|-----------------|---------|--------------|\n336\t\n337\t      | Qwen  | R-F1   | -0.51 | [-0.95, -0.08]  | 0.04    | marginal     |\n338\t\n339\t      | Qwen  | E-F1   | -0.25 | [-0.62, +0.11]  | 0.15    | no           |\n340\t\n341\t      | Llama | R-F1   | -0.30 | [-0.72, +0.10]  | 0.11    | no           |\n342\t\n343\t      | Llama | E-F1   | -0.38 | [-0.80, +0.05]  | 0.08    | no           |\n344\t\n345\t      '\n346\t  figures_description:\n347\t  - 'Forest plot: 4行（2模型×2指标），CI横条+零线, 直观展示FT composability的statistical evidence'\n348\t  analysis: Bootstrap CI在median tier下提供nuanced evidence：FT+constrained在DocRED上的 F1\n349\t    cost是real but small, 且model-dependent。最强的论文framing是\"FT composability at negligible\n350\t    cost\"而非\"zero cost\"——Qwen的marginal significance（p=0.04） 防止overclaim，Llama的non-significance（p=0.11）提供positive\n351\t    counterpoint。 与零代码DocRED的highly significant positive effect（R-F1 +0.50pp, p<0.001）\n352\t    形成对比：零代码regime有headroom for OOV elimination gains，FT regime没有。\n353\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6ffaff3-ff01-4c89-a912-e4c7491ed48f","uuid":"93d43c44-da7f-4290-94e4-db64ec484383","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:43:14.298Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T021434/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Composability claim requires calibration: ''OntoCoDec composes\n  with FT at minimal cost'' rather than ''zero cost.'' FT is the primary mechanism\n  for violation reduction (DR 18.7%→0.76% Qwen, 26.07%→0.49% Llama), OntoCoDec provides\n  the residual guarantee with a small but acceptable F1 trade-off in the FT regime.\n  DocRED high tightness (τ̄=0.842) causes more frequent grammar-first fallback than\n  SciERC (τ̄=0.333), explaining why DR does not reach 0% even with FT+constrained.\n  Well-calibrated FT models have less headroom for constraint-driven precision gains\n  — unlike zero-shot where grammar eliminates OOV FPs (RV 29.66%→0%), FT baseline\n  RV is already <0.3%, so grammar layer has negligible F1 benefit, while semantic\n  layer''s logit masking introduces mild overhead. Paper still strong: zero-shot results\n  are the core contribution; FT composability is §5.4 supplementary validation showing\n  method robustness. Soften ''zero F1 cost'' to ''negligible F1 cost'' in abstract.\n  Still targets Accept.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Qwen DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\n  plan_id: w5_qwen_docred_lora_constrained_eval\n  description: 'Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Qwen3-8B fine-tuned\n    with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix (base/FT\n    × unconstrained/constrained) for Qwen on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.76%,\n    RV=0.27%, ET=0%, CF=0.12%, R-F1=40.86%, E-F1=82.15%, parse_fail=7.11%.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.32\n    RV_pct: 0.0\n    ET_pct: 0.0\n    CF_pct: 1.5\n    R_F1: 40.35\n    R_precision: 36.05\n    R_recall: 45.8\n    E_F1: 81.9\n    E_precision: 85.2\n    E_recall: 78.85\n    parse_fail_rate_pct: 9.2\n    total_entities_pred: ~18050\n    total_relations_pred: ~15800\n    R_F1_delta_pp: -0.51\n    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.25\n    DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct: -57.9\n    CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp: 1.38\n  result_rationale: 'DR 0.76%→0.32%: FT已将DR从18.46%削减至0.76%（↓96%），残余主要集中在tight-constraint\n    关系（如P31_instance_of τ=0.98, P1001_applies_to_jurisdiction τ=0.95）。OntoCoDec semantic层可进一步消除部分残余，但DocRED\n    τ̄=0.842导致大量token位置触发 grammar-first fallback（零代码DocRED full_s1约57次/doc）。FT模型fallback频率略低\n    （模型输出更规范，减少空集交集），但仍显著高于SciERC。残余0.32%来自：(1) fallback 退化到grammar-only的token位置上，模型生成了合法关系名但违规的domain/range组合；\n    (2) FT模型在极少数tight-constraint关系上的latent DR violation（FT学到了常见pattern 但未完全覆盖罕见的合法entity-type对）。相比SciERC\n    FT+constrained的DR=0.0%（Qwen）， DocRED的非零残余反映了ontology complexity对constraint coverage的系统性影响。\n\n    RV/ET→0%: Grammar层确保——与FT无关，和零代码行为一致。\n\n    R-F1 40.86→40.35（-0.51pp）: FT模型RV baseline仅0.27%（vs零代码29.66%），grammar层 几乎无precision提升空间（零代码时grammar消除OOV\n    FP是F1提升的唯一来源）。同时semantic 层的logit masking在well-calibrated模型上产生轻微质量损失：FT模型的type\n    assignment已高度 准确，semantic mask偶尔会阻止模型的正确首选token，迫使其选择次优但合法的替代——这在 SciERC上影响极小（-0.09pp），但DocRED\n    96个关系×高tightness意味着更多masking事件累积 为可测量的F1下降。Recall略降（constraint偶尔导致relation slot生成次优triple），\n    precision略降（少量新引入的CF violation对应的triple被checker计为violation但all_set 评测仍计入FP）。-0.51pp在统计上可能仅marginal\n    significant（bootstrap p~0.03-0.08）， 是\"可接受的composability税\"而非方法缺陷。\n\n    CF 0.12%→1.5%: Semantic层引入entity-vs-relation type drift（与零代码机制相同）， 但FT模型已内化entity\n    type conventions，CF远低于零代码（零代码Qwen DocRED CF=2.57%）。 SciERC FT CF=1.18%是参考锚点；DocRED因96关系×高tightness导致更多semantic\n    enforcement 事件，CF略高于SciERC FT但远低于零代码。主要冲突模式预测：location↔country, organization↔political_party等DocRED\n    type system边界模糊区。\n\n    Parse fail 7.11%→9.2%（+2.1pp）: Qwen FT在DocRED上unconstrained已有较高parse failure （7.11%,\n    71/998 samples）。Constrained decoding的grammar enforcement在长文档上增加 generation复杂度，导致部分样本超时或生成中断。增幅与零代码（12/998→11/998，几乎不变）\n    不同，因为FT模型生成更长、更详细的输出（平均triple数~16-17per doc），constraint enforcement的累积overhead更大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Qwen DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix'\n    content: '| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\n\n      |---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\n\n      | Zero-shot unconst.  | 18.46 | 29.66 | 2.48 | 0.10  |  7.74  | 58.15  |\n\n      | Zero-shot full_s1   | 10.21 |  0.03 | 0.00 | 2.57  |  8.23  | 59.37  |\n\n      | FT unconstrained    |  0.76 |  0.27 | 0.00 | 0.12  | 40.86  | 82.15  |\n\n      | FT full_s1          |  0.32 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 1.50  | 40.35  | 81.90  |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Qwen DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)'\n    content: '| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR%\n      | Δ       |\n\n      |----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\n\n      | P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.8            | 0.9          | -0.9pp  |\n\n      | P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 1.2            | 0.4          | -0.8pp  |\n\n      | P710_participant           | 0.92  | 0.5            | 0.1          | -0.4pp  |\n\n      | Used-for (大部分)           | <0.5  | 0.0            | 0.0          | 0       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: DR reduction cascade across 4 configs (zero-shot-unc → zero-shot-const\n    → FT-unc → FT-const), 显示FT和OntoCoDec的互补贡献——FT负责bulk reduction (18.46→0.76), OntoCoDec负责residual\n    guarantee (0.76→0.32)'\n  - 'Scatter: relation tightness τ vs FT+constrained DR%, 预期只有τ>0.9的关系有非零DR残余, 与零代码pattern一致但整体水平低一个数量级'\n  analysis: 'Qwen DocRED FT+constrained结果在median tier下支持calibrated composability claim：\n    FT is the primary mechanism (DR↓96%), OntoCoDec provides marginal but real additional\n    reduction (0.76→0.32, ↓58%). R-F1 cost -0.51pp is the price of this guarantee,\n    acceptable for compliance-critical applications. 与SciERC FT+constrained（DR=0%,\n    R-F1=-0.09pp）的差距归因于ontology complexity: DocRED τ̄=0.842导致高fallback率， SciERC τ̄=0.333几乎不触发fallback。这不是方法局限而是可量化的tightness效应——\n    paper §5.4应报告fallback率差异作为解释。CF 1.5%与SciERC FT（1.18%）同量级， 确认FT大幅缓解CF问题（vs零代码CF=2.57%）。\n\n    论文framing调整：§5.4从\"FT+OntoCoDec = zero cost\"改为\"FT+OntoCoDec = negligible cost (R-F1\n    -0.5pp) with guaranteed DR reduction below 0.5%\"。Abstract中\"zero F1 cost\" 改为\"negligible\n    F1 cost in the FT regime\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama DocRED FT + OntoCoDec constrained eval\n  plan_id: w5_llama_docred_lora_constrained_eval\n  description: 'Full S1 constrained decoding (grammar+semantic) on Llama-3.1-8B fine-tuned\n    with LoRA on DocRED training set. Completes the 2×2 composability matrix for Llama\n    on DocRED. Baseline: FT unconstrained DR=0.49%, RV=0.15%, ET=0%, R-F1=43.72%,\n    E-F1=83.93%, parse_fail=2.3%.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.15\n    RV_pct: 0.0\n    ET_pct: 0.0\n    CF_pct: 2.0\n    R_F1: 43.42\n    R_precision: 38.4\n    R_recall: 50.1\n    E_F1: 83.55\n    E_precision: 84.6\n    E_recall: 82.52\n    parse_fail_rate_pct: 3.8\n    total_entities_pred: ~19050\n    total_relations_pred: ~16100\n    R_F1_delta_pp: -0.3\n    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.38\n    DR_reduction_from_ft_unconstrained_pct: -69.4\n    CF_increase_from_ft_unconstrained_pp: ~2.0\n  result_rationale: 'DR 0.49%→0.15%: Llama FT baseline DR已极低（0.49%），低于Qwen FT（0.76%）。\n    两个因素解释Llama更低的残余：(1) Llama在DocRED上zero-shot RV baseline较低 （16.03% vs Qwen 29.66%），FT后RV更接近零（0.15%），grammar层处理更少OOV→\n    semantic层获得更干净的输入→更少fallback事件；(2) Llama FT在SciERC上constrained DR=0.09%（vs Qwen\n    0.0%），显示两模型在低DR区间差异微小。DocRED残余0.15%来自 极少数high-tightness关系（P31 τ=0.98等），这些关系的constraint空间极窄，FT\n    无法完全学习所有合法pair，OntoCoDec在fallback区域也无法覆盖。\n\n    R-F1 43.72→43.42（-0.30pp）: Llama在SciERC FT+constrained上实现+0.02pp（中性）， 但DocRED的高tightness增加constraint\n    overhead。-0.30pp比Qwen（-0.51pp）更小， 与两模型在零代码上的pattern一致：Llama对constraint decoding更robust（零代码\n    DocRED R-F1 Llama +0.29pp vs Qwen +0.50pp，注意Qwen实际是从更低基线提升更多， 而Llama是从更高基线提升更少但也为正）。FT\n    regime下Llama的正向F1效应不再存在 （RV已被FT消除，无OOV FP可移除），剩余的是纯constraint overhead。-0.30pp在\n    bootstrap CI下预期p~0.05-0.15，即borderline significant——可报告为\"mild cost\" 但不构成论文攻击面。\n\n    CF 2.0%: Llama零代码DocRED CF=12.02%（远高于Qwen 2.57%），FT大幅降低但Llama 在CF上的系统性偏高延续到FT\n    regime。SciERC FT Llama CF=0.46%（低于Qwen 1.18%）， 但SciERC只有7个关系，DocRED 96个关系的type空间更复杂。预测2.0%——高于Qwen\n    FT+constrained（1.5%），因Llama在DocRED semantic enforcement下的entity-type drift更明显。这与零代码的跨模型pattern一致（Llama\n    DocRED CF始终高于Qwen）。 主要冲突模式：person↔politician, location↔country, organization↔company——\n    DocRED type system中语义重叠最严重的类别。\n\n    Parse fail 2.3%→3.8%（+1.5pp）: Llama FT parse stability优于Qwen（2.3% vs 7.11%）， constrained\n    decoding增加的overhead也更小。零代码Llama DocRED constrained parse failure从68→91（+2.3pp），FT模型输出更规范，增幅略低。3.8%仍远低于Qwen\n    FT+constrained的9.2%——跨模型parse robustness差异是系统性的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Llama DocRED 2×2 Composability Matrix'\n    content: '| Config              | DR%   | RV%   | ET%  | CF%   | R-F1   | E-F1   |\n\n      |---------------------|-------|-------|------|-------|--------|--------|\n\n      | Zero-shot unconst.  | 26.07 | 16.03 | 0.13 | 0.17  |  5.98  | 55.65  |\n\n      | Zero-shot full_s1   |  2.55 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 12.02 |  6.27  | 55.01  |\n\n      | FT unconstrained    |  0.49 |  0.15 | 0.00 | ~0    | 43.72  | 83.93  |\n\n      | FT full_s1          |  0.15 |  0.00 | 0.00 | 2.00  | 43.42  | 83.55  |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Llama DocRED FT+constrained per-relation DR (top violators)'\n    content: '| Relation                   | τ     | FT-unconst DR% | FT-const DR%\n      | Δ       |\n\n      |----------------------------|-------|----------------|--------------|---------|\n\n      | P31_instance_of            | 0.98  | 1.0            | 0.3          | -0.7pp  |\n\n      | P1001_applies_to_jurisd.   | 0.95  | 0.6            | 0.1          | -0.5pp  |\n\n      | Others (τ<0.9)             | <0.9  | ~0.0           | 0.0          | 0       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 跨模型DocRED FT+constrained对比 — Qwen vs Llama在DR/CF/R-F1三个指标上的对比,\n    显示Llama在DR和R-F1上更优但CF略高'\n  - 'Heatmap: 2模型×2数据集×4配置的DR矩阵, 对角线颜色梯度显示FT+constrained是最深绿色（最低DR）'\n  analysis: 'Llama DocRED FT+constrained在median tier下表现略优于Qwen：DR更低（0.15% vs 0.32%），\n    R-F1损失更小（-0.30pp vs -0.51pp），parse failure更低（3.8% vs 9.2%）。但CF更高 （2.0% vs 1.5%），延续了Llama在DocRED上CF偏高的系统性pattern。\n\n    跨模型composability claim在median tier下仍然成立但需要nuance：两个模型都实现了 DR<0.5%（远低于零代码的10-26%），R-F1代价均<1pp，确认FT+OntoCoDec是robust的\n    composable pipeline。但R-F1不再是\"zero cost\"——需要修改为\"minimal cost\"。\n\n    '\n- name: DocRED FT Composability 2×2 Matrix Analysis (Cross-Model)\n  plan_id: analysis_docred_ft_composability_cross_model\n  description: '综合Qwen和Llama两个模型在DocRED上的2×2矩阵（base/FT × unconstrained/constrained），\n    产出跨模型composability的统一分析。此分析在两个constrained eval完成后执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_dr_ft_constrained: 0.32\n    llama_dr_ft_constrained: 0.15\n    qwen_r_f1_delta_ft_regime: -0.51\n    llama_r_f1_delta_ft_regime: -0.3\n    qwen_cf_ft_constrained: 1.5\n    llama_cf_ft_constrained: 2.0\n    ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_qwen: 96\n    ft_contribution_dr_reduction_pct_llama: 98\n    ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_qwen: 58\n    ontodec_residual_contribution_pct_llama: 69\n    total_dr_reduction_pct_qwen: 98.3\n    total_dr_reduction_pct_llama: 99.4\n  result_rationale: '2×2矩阵的核心insight是FT和OntoCoDec在DR reduction pipeline中占据不同阶段： FT负责bulk\n    reduction（18-26%→0.5-0.8%，↓96-98%），OntoCoDec负责residual guarantee（0.5-0.8%→0.15-0.32%，再↓58-69%）。两阶段组合实现98-99%总DR消除。\n\n    在median tier下，composability的代价是非零的：R-F1损失0.3-0.5pp，CF增加 1.5-2.0pp。这些代价在SciERC\n    FT regime几乎不存在（R-F1 ±0.1pp, CF 0.5-1.2%）， 差异归因于DocRED ontology complexity（τ̄=0.842\n    vs 0.333）。\n\n    关键发现：FT+OntoCoDec对CF的影响远小于零代码+OntoCoDec——SciERC从9.90%降至 1.18%（Qwen）/ 0.46%（Llama），DocRED预期从2.57%到1.5%（Qwen）/\n    12.02%到 2.0%（Llama）。FT通过内化entity type conventions大幅减少entity-vs-relation type drift。这支持\"FT\n    resolves the CF trade-off that is the primary limitation in zero-shot deployment\"的framing——CF不再是Limitation\n    #1，而是已被FT缓解的 secondary concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Model DocRED Composability Summary'\n    content: '| Metric               | Qwen zero-shot | Qwen FT    | Llama zero-shot\n      | Llama FT   |\n\n      |----------------------|----------------|------------|-----------------|------------|\n\n      | DR (unconst.)        | 18.46%         | 0.76%      | 26.07%          | 0.49%      |\n\n      | DR (constrained)     | 10.21%         | 0.32%      | 2.55%           | 0.15%      |\n\n      | DR Δ (const-unconst) | -8.25pp        | -0.44pp    | -23.52pp        | -0.34pp    |\n\n      | R-F1 (unconst.)      | 7.74           | 40.86      | 5.98            | 43.72      |\n\n      | R-F1 (constrained)   | 8.23           | 40.35      | 6.27            | 43.42      |\n\n      | R-F1 Δ               | +0.49pp        | -0.51pp    | +0.29pp         | -0.30pp    |\n\n      | CF (constrained)     | 2.57%          | 1.50%      | 12.02%          | 2.00%      |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: DR Attribution — FT vs OntoCoDec Contribution'\n    content: '| Model | Baseline DR | After FT | After FT+OntoCoDec | FT contrib.\n      | OntoCoDec contrib. |\n\n      |-------|------------|----------|--------------------|-------------|-------------------|\n\n      | Qwen  | 18.46%     | 0.76%    | 0.32%              | ↓95.9%      | ↓57.9%\n      of residual |\n\n      | Llama | 26.07%     | 0.49%    | 0.15%              | ↓98.1%      | ↓69.4%\n      of residual |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: DR reduction分解为FT contribution和OntoCoDec contribution, 两个模型并排, 直观展示''FT\n    does the heavy lifting, OntoCoDec provides the residual guarantee'''\n  - 'Line plot: R-F1 across 4 configs (x=config, y=R-F1), 两条线(Qwen/Llama), 标注FT→FT+const的delta,\n    显示FT regime下constrained decoding的marginal F1 cost'\n  analysis: \"Median tier下的论文叙事调整：\\n1. Abstract: \\\"zero F1 cost\\\" → \\\"negligible F1\\\n    \\ cost (≤0.5pp) in the fine-tuned\\n   regime, with zero cost confirmed in zero-shot\\\n    \\ settings\\\"\\n\\n2. §5.4 FT Composability: 核心message是\\\"OntoCoDec composes with\\\n    \\ FT at minimal\\n   cost, providing guaranteed DR<0.5% that FT alone cannot achieve.\\\"\\\n    \\ 报告具体的\\n   R-F1 cost（-0.3 to -0.5pp）和DR benefit（additional 58-69% reduction of\\n\\\n    \\   FT residual）。Acknowledge这是composability tax，但对比post-hoc filtering\\n   的recall\\\n    \\ loss（-1.06pp DocRED）和information loss（48.1% triples rejected），\\n   OntoCoDec的trade-off更favorable。\\n\\\n    \\n3. CF discussion: FT+OntoCoDec CF（1.5-2.0%）远低于零代码+OntoCoDec CF\\n   （2.57-12.02%），这是positive\\\n    \\ finding。在§7 Limitations中保留CF作为\\n   inherent limitation，但补充\\\"FT substantially\\\n    \\ mitigates CF (88% reduction\\n   on SciERC, 42-83% on DocRED)\\\"。\\n\\n4. 投稿策略:\\\n    \\ Median tier下论文仍targets Accept——核心贡献（violation landscape\\n   + method + zero-shot\\\n    \\ results）不受影响，FT composability section变为\\\"§5.4\\n   analysis showing method robustness\\\n    \\ under different training regimes\\\"而非\\n   headline claim。总体预期评分3.5-4.0，主要风险从FT\\\n    \\ composability转移回CF\\n   trade-off和novelty perception。\\n\"\n- name: Bootstrap CI for DocRED FT Composability\n  plan_id: analysis_bootstrap_ci_docred_ft\n  description: '对两个模型的DocRED FT+constrained vs FT+unconstrained进行bootstrap CI（10000\n    iterations），验证R-F1 delta的统计显著性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_r_f1_delta_pp: -0.51\n    qwen_r_f1_95ci_lower: -0.95\n    qwen_r_f1_95ci_upper: -0.08\n    qwen_p_value: 0.04\n    qwen_significance: marginal (p<0.05 but CI wide)\n    llama_r_f1_delta_pp: -0.3\n    llama_r_f1_95ci_lower: -0.72\n    llama_r_f1_95ci_upper: 0.1\n    llama_p_value: 0.11\n    llama_significance: not significant (CI crosses zero)\n    qwen_e_f1_delta_pp: -0.25\n    qwen_e_f1_p_value: 0.15\n    llama_e_f1_delta_pp: -0.38\n    llama_e_f1_p_value: 0.08\n  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI在median tier下的预期pattern：\n\n    Qwen R-F1 -0.51pp: DocRED有998个文档，FT模型每文档~16-17 triples，给予足够 统计功效检测0.5pp级别的差异。预期p~0.04（marginal\n    significant），95% CI [-0.95, -0.08]——不跨零但upper bound接近零。这意味着差异是real的但small。 论文可报告为\"statistically\n    detectable but practically negligible\"。\n\n    Llama R-F1 -0.30pp: 更小的effect size + Llama更高的parse failure（降低有效 样本量）→ 预期p~0.11（not\n    significant）。CI [-0.72, +0.10]跨零。这实际上 是positive outcome——无法拒绝\"Llama FT+constrained\n    R-F1 ≈ FT unconstrained\" 的零假设，支持\"negligible cost\" framing。\n\n    E-F1的delta更小（-0.25, -0.38pp），在E-F1的基数（82-84%）下effect size更小， 预期均not significant——constrained\n    decoding对entity extraction的影响在FT regime下可忽略。\n\n    论文reporting策略：只需报告R-F1的bootstrap CI。如果Qwen marginal significant 而Llama not significant，frame为\"R-F1\n    cost is model-dependent: Qwen shows a small but detectable -0.5pp decline (p=0.04),\n    while Llama shows no significant change (-0.3pp, p=0.11)\"。这比uniform \"no cost\"\n    claim更honest也更robust。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap CI for FT Composability on DocRED'\n    content: '| Model | Metric | Δpp   | 95% CI          | p-value | Significant?\n      |\n\n      |-------|--------|-------|-----------------|---------|--------------|\n\n      | Qwen  | R-F1   | -0.51 | [-0.95, -0.08]  | 0.04    | marginal     |\n\n      | Qwen  | E-F1   | -0.25 | [-0.62, +0.11]  | 0.15    | no           |\n\n      | Llama | R-F1   | -0.30 | [-0.72, +0.10]  | 0.11    | no           |\n\n      | Llama | E-F1   | -0.38 | [-0.80, +0.05]  | 0.08    | no           |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 4行（2模型×2指标），CI横条+零线, 直观展示FT composability的statistical evidence'\n  analysis: Bootstrap CI在median tier下提供nuanced evidence：FT+constrained在DocRED上的 F1\n    cost是real but small, 且model-dependent。最强的论文framing是\"FT composability at negligible\n    cost\"而非\"zero cost\"——Qwen的marginal significance（p=0.04） 防止overclaim，Llama的non-significance（p=0.11）提供positive\n    counterpoint。 与零代码DocRED的highly significant positive effect（R-F1 +0.50pp, p<0.001）\n    形成对比：零代码regime有headroom for OOV elimination gains，FT regime没有。\n","numLines":353,"startLine":1,"totalLines":353}}}
